    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "cacherelay-prometheus" },
      "description": "Memory fragmentation ratio per tier. Above 1.5 on the accounting tier means allocator overhead is eating the maxmemory budget. Display clamps the plot at 3.0; the stat/legend text shows the raw value (live cache tier reports ~13.6 with tiny resident memory — the ratio is mathematical, not a fault).",
      "fieldConfig": {
